<title>USA: Plexus preferred converted to common.</title>
<headline>Plexus preferred converted to common.</headline>
<dateline>NEENAH, Wis. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plexus Corp said Monday it issued 554,454 shares of common stock to holders who converted their Series A preferred stock, effective February 28.</p>
<p>It issued the common stock in lieu of redeeming the preferred at its face value of $7 million.</p>
<p>Plexus is a contract provider of design, manufacturing and testing services to the electronics industry.</p>
<p>	 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
